graph TD
    RAW[Technology Raw Metrics TM-001..TM-012] --> SEG[Subsegment Resolution]
    SEG --> ARCH[Archetype Resolution]
    ARCH --> PROF[Calibration Profile Selection]
    PROF --> EBT[Effective Band-Table Resolution<br/>calibrated ?? baseline<br/>boundaries + scores together<br/>conservativeBandTable() on conflict]
    EBT --> MBS[Metric to Band to Score]
    MBS --> PILLAR[Pillars: Quality / Growth / Risk / Profitability / CapitalEfficiency / Valuation]
    PILLAR --> WTS[Effective Weights / Risk Multiplier<br/>wR = wR x archetype_risk]
    WTS --> COMP[Composite Score<br/>round_half_to_even at composite]
    COMP --> OVR[Override Min-Rank<br/>finalVerdict = min_rank(base, caps)]
    OVR --> VERDICT[Verdict: Strong Buy..Avoid]
    COMP --> EVID[TechnologyEvidence + Resolved Calibration Version]
    EVID --> SNAP[Snapshot + Replay]
    VERDICT --> ONTO[Ontology Registration]
    ONTO --> CSIP[CSIP / Portfolio Intelligence]

    style EBT fill:#eaf6ff,stroke:#2b6cb0
    style COMP fill:#f0fff4,stroke:#2f855a
    style OVR fill:#fffaf0,stroke:#c05621
